{"id":"cbf26fce63165619","group":"67","path":"67/67-df-hypersimple-set.md","title":"Hypersimple Sets and Disjoint Finite Arrays","display":"df-hypersimple-set — Hypersimple Sets and Disjoint Finite Arrays","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom","book_abbrev":"67","label":"67-df-hypersimple-set","aliases":["67-df-hypersimple-set"],"display":"df-hypersimple-set — Hypersimple Sets and Disjoint Finite Arrays","depends_on":["[[67-df-recursively-enumerable-predicate]]","[[67-df-recursive-function-class]]"],"revision_status":"locally-reconstructed","machine_verified":false,"verification_status":"local-interface-and-dependency-checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"revision_date":"2026-10-14"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"67"},{"key":"label","html":"67-df-hypersimple-set"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>67-df-hypersimple-set</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-hypersimple-set — Hypersimple Sets and Disjoint Finite Arrays"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b59d5ff6e43660a9\" href=\"?note=b59d5ff6e43660a9\" title=\"67-df-recursively-enumerable-predicate\">67-df-recursively-enumerable-predicate</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5f966a5415552b4e\" href=\"?note=5f966a5415552b4e\" title=\"67-df-recursive-function-class\">67-df-recursive-function-class</a></span></div>"},{"key":"revision_status","html":"locally-reconstructed"},{"key":"machine_verified","html":"false"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"local-interface-and-dependency-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-14"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(H\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_n\">\\(D_n\\)</span> 是由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 的二进制有效给出的有限集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h\\in\\mathrm{Rec}_1\">\\(h\\in\\mathrm{Rec}_1\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|\\mathbb N\\setminus H|=\\aleph_0\">\\(|\\mathbb N\\setminus H|=\\aleph_0\\)</span> 表示补集无限。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{StrongArray}(h)\">\\(\\mathrm{StrongArray}(h)\\)</span> 要求各 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_{h(i)}\">\\(D_{h(i)}\\)</span> 非空且两两不交；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Hypersimple}\">\\(\\mathrm{Hypersimple}\\)</span> 是下式定义的元层谓词。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nD_n&amp;\\coloneqq\\{i\\in\\mathbb N:\\lfloor n/2^i\\rfloor\\equiv1\\pmod2\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{StrongArray}(h)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow h\\in\\mathrm{Rec}_1\\land\\forall i\\ (D_{h(i)}\\ne\\varnothing)\\land\\forall i&lt;j\\ (D_{h(i)}\\cap D_{h(j)}=\\varnothing),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Hypersimple}(H)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{RE}_1(H)\\land|\\mathbb N\\setminus H|=\\aleph_0\\land\\forall h\\ (\\mathrm{StrongArray}(h)\\to\\exists i\\ D_{h(i)}\\subseteq H).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nD_n&amp;\\coloneqq\\{i\\in\\mathbb N:\\lfloor n/2^i\\rfloor\\equiv1\\pmod2\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{StrongArray}(h)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow h\\in\\mathrm{Rec}_1\\land\\forall i\\ (D_{h(i)}\\ne\\varnothing)\\land\\forall i&lt;j\\ (D_{h(i)}\\cap D_{h(j)}=\\varnothing),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Hypersimple}(H)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{RE}_1(H)\\land|\\mathbb N\\setminus H|=\\aleph_0\\land\\forall h\\ (\\mathrm{StrongArray}(h)\\to\\exists i\\ D_{h(i)}\\subseteq H).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>该接口补齐原悬空的 hypersimple-set 依赖。严格递增递归函数产生的区间是上述有限阵列的特例。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"67-df-recursively-enumerable-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"b59d5ff6e43660a9","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-recursively-enumerable-predicate]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-recursive-function-class","status":"resolved","id":"5f966a5415552b4e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-recursive-function-class]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"H\\subseteq\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"D_n","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"h\\in\\mathrm{Rec}_1","display":false},{"tex":"|\\mathbb N\\setminus H|=\\aleph_0","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{StrongArray}(h)","display":false},{"tex":"D_{h(i)}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Hypersimple}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nD_n&\\coloneqq\\{i\\in\\mathbb N:\\lfloor n/2^i\\rfloor\\equiv1\\pmod2\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{StrongArray}(h)&\\Longleftrightarrow h\\in\\mathrm{Rec}_1\\land\\forall i\\ (D_{h(i)}\\ne\\varnothing)\\land\\forall i<j\\ (D_{h(i)}\\cap D_{h(j)}=\\varnothing),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Hypersimple}(H)&\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{RE}_1(H)\\land|\\mathbb N\\setminus H|=\\aleph_0\\land\\forall h\\ (\\mathrm{StrongArray}(h)\\to\\exists i\\ D_{h(i)}\\subseteq H).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1483,"backlinks":[{"id":"3dfb8d24daf96156","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"相邻第90册已有 [[67-df-hypersimple-set]]，用补集主函数不受递归函数支配定义 $\\mathrm{HSimple}(H)$。本条没有另造一个同名定义，也没有未经证明把该签名直接等同于这里的区间条件；它记录第67册实际使用的精确存在引理。"},{"id":"38502195e450dd58","anchor":"ref-84","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../67-df-hypersimple-set]] — Hypersimple Sets and Disjoint Finite Arrays。"},{"id":"aceae1bb446510ab","anchor":"ref-41","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../67-df-hypersimple-set]]"},{"id":"161ada0e6be38670","anchor":"ref-88","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../67-df-hypersimple-set]]"}],"outgoing":["b59d5ff6e43660a9","5f966a5415552b4e"]}